# UI Design — Neat & Clean

Build screens that feel calm, professional, and easy to scan. Prefer clarity over decoration.

## Visual Principles

- One clear purpose per screen/section
- Strong visual hierarchy: title → primary action → supporting content
- Generous whitespace; avoid cramped or crowded layouts
- Consistent alignment on a vertical rhythm
- Limit accent color; use neutrals for most chrome
- No visual noise: no unnecessary cards, borders, shadows, chips, or badges
- Cards only when they group interactive or related content that needs separation

## Layout Hygiene

- Consistent padding from screen edges (use spacing tokens)
- Equal gaps between sibling items; avoid random pixel values
- Group related controls; separate unrelated blocks with clear space
- Primary CTA visible and uncluttered; secondary actions quieter
- Empty, loading, and error states must look intentional — not blank or broken

## Typography & Icons

- Use theme text styles only (`Theme.of(context).textTheme`)
- Prefer fewer type sizes; do not invent one-off font sizes
- Icons from one style set; match size to text line height
- Truncate long text with ellipsis; never overflow

## Forms & Lists

- Clear labels, helpful hints, and visible validation errors
- Comfortable tap targets (min ~48dp)
- Lists: `ListView.builder` / lazy widgets; dividers only when they aid scanning
- Prefer simple rows over nested nested cards

## Do / Don't

```dart
// ✅ GOOD — token spacing, theme text, calm layout
Padding(
  padding: EdgeInsets.all(AppSpacing.md),
  child: Column(
    crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.stretch,
    children: [
      Text(title, style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.titleLarge),
      SizedBox(height: AppSpacing.sm),
      Text(subtitle, style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.bodyMedium),
    ],
  ),
);

// ❌ BAD — magic numbers, Colors.*, noisy nesting
Container(
  margin: EdgeInsets.all(13),
  decoration: BoxDecoration(
    color: Colors.white,
    boxShadow: [BoxShadow(blurRadius: 20, color: Colors.black26)],
  ),
  child: ...,
);
```
